{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_89","text":"And don't worry, there's no danger involved.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_90","text":"We're calling it a mission, sure, but really, this is just an événement.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_91","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_92","text":"Also, make sure the Commandant reçoive ce message:","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_93","text":"Evade the guests' pursuit. Catch la mystérieuse thief. Retrieve the target.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_94","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_95","text":"Message relayed to Noob.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_96","text":"The response: \"What are you talking about?\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_97","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_97","text":"I don't blame him.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_98","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_98","text":"There was no reason to start this whole damn fiasco in the first place.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_99","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_99","text":"You could have just told everyone, \"Don't mind her, folks. Just relax and enjoy the event.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_100","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_100","text":"Then we just catch the thief, and bam, case closed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_101","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_101","text":"... It's too late for that now, after what the thief said.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_102","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_102","text":"The guests just won't buy it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_103","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_103","text":"Yes, I agree.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_104","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_104","text":"After such a public declaration, there's no way to just pretend it never happened.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_105","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_105","text":"Even if we could... both the guests and participants","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_106","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_106","text":"wouldn't be able to properly focus on the event.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_107","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_107","text":"You're right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_108","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_108","text":"Since things are already en marche, we can't just act like nothing happened.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_109","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_109","text":"But...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_110","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_110","text":"Luckily for us, it's turning into quite un véritable spectacle.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_111","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_111","text":"The Commandant pursues la thief, and the guests pursue le Commandant.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_112","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_112","text":"Who will claim la gloire and stand as le victor? Don't you want to find out?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_113","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_113","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush2_01_e_114","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush2_01_e_114","text":"And since this is an urgent mission,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bg